<title>UK: London reinsurance statistics show recovery -LIRMA.</title>
<headline>London reinsurance statistics show recovery -LIRMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London insurance market enjoyed a pick up in business in 1995, the London International Insurance and Reinsurance Market Association (LIRMA) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The survey of companies accounting for two thirds of total turnover of LIRMA member firms showed a 15 percent rise in gross premiums to nearly 3.4 billion stg.</p>
<p>Net premiums rose 21 percent to 2.1 billion stg.</p>
<p>Business and geographical mix were little changed over the year and competition in the market remained tight, said LIRMA.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542</p>
</text>
